<title>SWEDEN: TV4, Marieberg trade at 1310 GMT.</title>
<headline>TV4, Marieberg trade at 1310 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in TV4 and Swedish media group Tidnings AB Marieberg will resume at 1310 GMT, the Stockholm Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The exchange stopped trade before market open on Tuesday ahead of an announcement that Marieberg had bought a 16.7 percent stake in the television station.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
</text>
